{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "021jun_402_2_4_021_02_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:f82ad4ada296920b035942698886774031667547045798ebb63a63667dbdf361",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:021jun_402_2_4_021_02_09_b:2_4_021_02_09_b:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d428df5a636494ee14915aaa9af04e2820bb1c8fa0632ce86c60a857a4f92f37",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:021jun_402_2_4_021_02_09_b:2_4_021_02_09_b:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70f551edb4ddee7808aed8ba7351ea5255531e2671e17bc77e06ca19cce92060",
      "text": "派对的准备很顺利。\n我只是觉得姑且向您汇报一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:021jun_402_2_4_021_02_09_b:2_4_021_02_09_b:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8039332ebd53d41e165f6dfaf057b2caafe63b5fb10575a2ff6bbd8ea60908b8",
      "text": "料理看起来有点辛苦，不过当天冬马君和\n诚司先生他们好像也会过来帮忙。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:021jun_402_2_4_021_02_09_b:2_4_021_02_09_b:cmd-000014:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5c26bd8ee40489a849aca82fa6fb3b76973c36c6480261dd13ea6e3645104fa",
      "text": "感到乐在其中吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:021jun_402_2_4_021_02_09_b:2_4_021_02_09_b:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17be1919ca908281abec16d87c447ceda8749234d562c6061fdf454e28e05a08",
      "text": "乐在其中？我吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:021jun_402_2_4_021_02_09_b:2_4_021_02_09_b:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d53b5813160e87d6ea5495f23d22ce8395ec012ab99a1a0fe2f86b1dc256f755",
      "text": "我们不应该是带给别人快乐的一方吗？为此，\n才会在事务所的派对上也担任干事的吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:021jun_402_2_4_021_02_09_b:2_4_021_02_09_b:cmd-000021:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:061c6d6f9d6baed6f7db11341927bdaac9ce09efb5feb552b3a4ef298d7ebabf",
      "text": "自己感到快乐也很重要哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:021jun_402_2_4_021_02_09_b:2_4_021_02_09_b:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a9b7b20128311727f2e3d10e8082ee6571cc11780d22b871cb9bad4b6be7689",
      "text": "这样啊……如果我们自己都不快乐的话，\n客人们可能也不会开心呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:021jun_402_2_4_021_02_09_b:2_4_021_02_09_b:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9a69c383264e53ebb6c4460e5f3b267d10047fe15f7ce3063aa656e3ed0bfb9",
      "text": "我明白了，我会注意这一点的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:021jun_402_2_4_021_02_09_b:2_4_021_02_09_b:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13a7d25c0285903da87b4ce274fa6c58995d68dafa0b5f4e5bd92762cee8a677",
      "text": "……说得也是。准备时这种热闹的气氛，\n我觉得并不坏哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:021jun_402_2_4_021_02_09_b:2_4_021_02_09_b:cmd-000030:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ef6cf115f6b97a16e78b9a9c9de44406756979ab0f30989e6685e99fc48174a",
      "text": "那么，制作人。\n稍后再联络。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
